<title>PERU: Peru's money base expands 3.4 pct in November.</title>
<headline>Peru's money base expands 3.4 pct in November.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's money base expanded 3.4 percent during November to stand at 3.519 billion soles at the end of the month, the Central Reserve Bank said Monday.</p>
<p>The money base ended last year at 3.658 billion soles, up from 2.672 billion at the start of 1995.</p>
<p>-- Saul Hudson, Lima Newsroom 511 221-2134</p>
</text>
